:INFO
Art. 54 Toxicological Information Centre
Article 79 of the ChemO applies with regard to the Toxicological Information Centre.
|

:NOTE
Art. 54 — Amended by No I of the O of 5 June 2015, in force since 1 July 2015 (AS 2015 1985).
